N|               photo. Under it is the name: "CHARLES LAMPERT."
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- REGGIE AND GRANDPIERRE
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         Of course it is.
O|
C|                                     GRANDPIERRE
U|                         And this?
O|
N|               He hands her another passport.
O|
T|               INSERT -- SECOND PASSPORT
O|
N,G|               The cover is American. When it is opened, we see the identical 
N,G|               picture, but the name under it reads: "CHARLES VOSS."
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- REGGIE AND GRANDPIERRE
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         I don't understand.
O|
C|                                     GRANDPIERRE
