O|
N|               GIDEON arrives at the coffin. He stops, looks down at 
N|               LAMPERT's body for a moment. Then, suddenly, in rapid 
N|               succession, he sneezes six times. He takes a small bottle 
N|               from his pocket, shakes a pill from it and swallows it dry.
O|
N|               He turns and walks back up the aisle, looking for a place to 
N|               sit. He comes face to face with GRANDPIERRE, stops, turns to 
N|               sit somewhere else.
O|
