O|
C|                                     SYLVIE
U|                         Do you know him?
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         I've never seen him before.
O|
C|                                     SYLVIE
U|                         He must have known Charles pretty 
U|                         well.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         How can you tell?
O|
C|                                     SYLVIE
U|                         He's allergic to him.
O|
