N,G,I|               Closing the door, we see HERMAN SCOBIE, a heavy-weight -- 
N,I|               tall and wide, but not fat -- with black hair combed straight 
N,I|               back and heavy bushy eyebrows of a matching color, which 
N,I|               meet over his nose and join up. About the same age as the 
N|               first two men, SCOBIE is dressed in a battered raincoat, his 
N|               hands thrust deep in the pockets. He marches down the aisle. 
