O|
N,G|               CLOSE SHOT -- SCOBIE
O|
N|               He watches the dead man carefully, still squinting. Then 
N|               finally satisfied, he returns the pin to his lapel and walks 
N|               back up the aisle and out of the door, slamming it after 
