U|                         Yes -- and he was there, too -- a 
U|                         little fatter now -- and less hair -- 
U|                         but it's the same one.
O|
C,E|                                     BARTHOLOMEW'S VOICE (O.S.)
U|                         Do you know him, Mrs. Vo -- Mrs. 
