O|
C,E|                                     PETER'S VOICE (O.S.)
U|                         What's she saying now?
O|
C,E|                                     REGGIE'S VOICE (O.S.)
U|                         That she's innocent -- she didn't do 
U|                         it.
O|
C,E|                                     PETER'S VOICE (O.S.)
U|                         She did it, all right -- take it 
U|                         from me.
