O|
S|               INT. NIGHTCLUB LOUNGE -- NIGHT
O|
N|               As REGGIE looks around. There is no one there.
O|
S|               INT. PHONE BOOTH
O|
N|               As REGGIE returns, sits and starts to put another jeton into 
