N|               and unravels some more until it seems that the entire sock 
N|               has come unknit. Now, taking the long thread, he bends down 
N|               near the door and, taking his tie-pin, attaches one end of 
N|               the thread to the bottom of REGGIE's door. He then runs the 
N|               thread along the floor to his door (next door) and works it 
N|               underneath.
