N|               frantically.
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         Taxi -- ! Taxi -- !
O|
N|               It pulls up and DYLE opens the door.
O|
C|                                     DYLE
P|                              (pointing)
U|                         Follow that taxi.
O|
C|                                     DRIVER
U|                         Comment?
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         Taxi! Follow!
O|
C|                                     DRIVER
U|                         Je ne comprends rien.
O|
N|               Desperately, DYLE reaches into his coat pocket and pulls out 
N|               a small dictionary and begins flipping through the pages.
O|
N,G|               CLOSE SHOT -- REGGIE
O|
N|               In the shadows. She lifts her eyes in annoyance.
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- TAXI
O|
C|                                     DYLE
P|                              (finding the word)
U|                         Suivre -- el taxi!
O|
C|                                     DRIVER
U|                         Ah! Oui, Monsieur.
O|
