U|                         Gratinée, choucroute garnie, salade 
U|                         de pommes -- et un ballon de rouge.
O|
C|                                     BARTHOLOMEW
U|                         Mrs. Lampert, I really hadn't planned 
U|                         on spending the entire night here.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         Can I at least keep the onion soup?
O|
N|               BARTHOLOMEW shrugs.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
P|                              (to the WAITER)
U|                         La soupe tout simplement.
O|
N|               The WAITER nods and goes.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
P|                              (anxiously)
U|                         Go on, please -- five men -- $250,000 -- 
U|                         the French Underground --
O|
C|                                     BARTHOLOMEW
U|                         Yes. The five men. They were, of 
U|                         course, your husband, Charles, the 
U|                         three men who showed up at his funeral 
U|                         yesterday, and Carson Dyle. But 
U|                         something went wrong and they were 
U|                         unable to locate their contact. It 
U|                         must have been at that point that 
U|                         they decided to steal the money.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         Steal it how?
O|
C|                                     BARTHOLOMEW
U|                         By burying it, and then reporting 
U|                         that the Germans had captured it.  
U|                         All they had to do was come back 
U|                         after the war, dig it up and split 
U|                         it five ways -- a quarter of a million 
U|                         dollars with no questions asked.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
P|                              (fascinated)
U|                         May I have a cigarette, please?
O|
N|               BARTHOLOMEW pulls out a package and she takes one, looks at 
N|               it and rips off the filter tip. He winces.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         I hate these things -- it's like 
U|                         drinking coffee through a veil.
O|
