O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         I hope I don't find any little hairy 
U|                         things living up here -- wait! There 
U|                         is something! If I can just -- yes, 
U|                         I'm getting it -- a case of some 
U|                         sort -- it's heavy.
O|
C|                                     JEAN-LOUIS
P|                              (jumping up and down)
U|                         I found it! I found it!
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         If you think you're getting credit 
U|                         for this, you're crazy.
O|
C|                                     JEAN-LOUIS
P|                              (ecstatic)
U|                         We won! We won!
O|
