N|               rectangular black bag about the size and shape of a trombone 
N|               case. As he climbs off the chair, JEAN-LOUIS suddenly runs 
N,G|               to the door, unbolts it and runs into the hall, CAMERA PANNING 
N,G|               with him.
O|
