O|
N,G|               CLOSE SHOT -- SCOBIE. The dead man's eyes are open, his jaw 
N|               hanging, his head lying crazily on the pillow.
O|
N,G|               CAMERA PULLS BACK to show him lying in bed, dressed in his 
N,G|               pajamas. CAMERA WHIRLS for a TIGHT CLOSE SHOT of a MAID, her 
N|               eyes widening as the realization that the man is dead strikes 
N|               her. Then she screams.
O|
S|               INT. GRANDPIERRE'S OFFICE -- LATE AFTERNOON
O|
N,G|               CLOSE SHOT -- GRANDPIERRE. The policeman is apoplectic.
O|
C|                                     GRANDPIERRE
U|                         No! No! No! No!
O|
N,G|               CAMERA PULLS BACK to include, REGGIE, DYLE, TEX and GIDEON, 
N|               all sitting silently in the INSPECTOR's office.
