C|                                     GRANDPIERRE
U|                         A man drowned in his bed -- 
U|                         impossible! And in his pajamas -- 
U|                         the second one in his pajamas -- 
U|                         c'est trop bête! Stop lying to me --
P|                              (Tapping the side of 
P|                              his nose)
U|                         this nose tells me when you are lying --
U|                         it is never mistaken, not in twenty-
U|                         three years -- this nose will make 
U|                         me commissaire of police.
P|                              (Tapping his fingers 
P|                              on his desk)
U|                         Mr. Dyle or Mr. Joshua -- which is 
U|                         it?
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         Dyle.
O|
