U|                         Mr. Joshua. Do you know it is against 
U|                         the law to register under an assumed 
U|                         name?
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         No, I didn't.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         It's done in America all the time.
O|
N|               GRANDPIERRE raps for silence on his desk. During the pause, 
N|               he looks into each face in turn.
O|
C|                                     GRANDPIERRE
U|                         None of you will be permitted to 
U|                         leave Paris -- until this matter is 
U|                         cleared up. Only I warn you -- I 
U|                         will be watching. We use the 
U|                         guillotine in this country -- I have 
U|                         always suspected that the blade coming 
U|                         down causes no more than a slight 
U|                         tickling sensation on the back of 
U|                         the neck. It is only a guess, of 
U|                         course -- I hope none of you ever 
U|                         finds out for certain.
O|
D|               DELETED
