N|               REGGIE and DYLE walking along the quai, next to the Seine, 
N,G|               CAMERA LEADING.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         Who do you think did it -- Gideon?
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         Maybe.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         Or Tex?
O|
C|                                     DYLE
U|                         Maybe.
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
