O|
N|               An OPERATOR speaking into a headset.
O|
C|                                     OPERATOR
U|                         Could you speak out, please? I can't 
U|                         quite hear you.
O|
S|               INT. PHONE BOOTH -- NIGHT
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
P|                              (on the phone)
U|                         No, I can't speak any louder -- 
U|                         Hamilton Bartholomew -- B as in -- 
