O|
S|               INT. MÉTRO SORTIE -- NIGHT
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- PHONE BOOTH. As REGGIE's head appears, peeking 
N|               cautiously over the bottom of the window.
O|
N,G|               REVERSE SHOT
O|
N|               From inside the phone booth. Through the glass ADAM can be 
N|               seen, leaving the Sortie area.
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- PHONE BOOTH
O|
N|               Carefully, REGGIE opens the door and comes out. She goes to 
N|               the corner and looks around it.
O|
S|               INT. MÉTRO PLATFORM -- NIGHT
O|
N,G|               From REGGIE'S P.O.V. as ADAM walks away from CAMERA, down
O|
N,G|               the platform. CAMERA PANS TO REGGIE, peeking around the 
N|               corner. She looks the opposite way, sees another exit at the 
N,M|               other end of the platform (also marked "SORTIE"). She looks 
