N|               running towards the exit.
O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- ADAM
O|
N|               As the bell rings announcing the next train. He turns to 
N|               look and sees REGGIE.
O|
C|                                     ADAM
P|                              (calling)
U|                         Reggie -- !
