O|
N,G|               MED. SHOT -- REGGIE
O|
N|               As she runs, ADAM several yards behind her.
O|
C|                                     ADAM
P|                              (in b.g., calling)
U|                         Reggie -- wait!
O|
N|               She turns into the exit.
O|
S|               INT. MÉTRO STAIRWAY -- NIGHT
O|
N|               As REGGIE starts up the long, steep flight of stone steps 
N|               leading to the street level. ADAM appears behind her, climbing 
N|               two at a time and gaining.
O|
C|                                     ADAM
U|                         Reggie -- why won't you listen?
O|
C|                                     REGGIE
U|                         I'm through listening to you!
O|
